OL,3,AJensen Huang says he would return as
OL,4,ANvidia boss if asked by the board
OL,5,
OL,6,FJensen Huang has said he would be
OL,7,F"honored" to return as the boss of tech
OL,8,Fgiant Nvidia, in his first public
OL,9,Fcomments since his shock resignation
OL,10,Fafter reports he had extramarital
OL,11,Faffairs, including with an alleged
OL,12,FChinese spy.
OL,14,FIn a statement shared with the BBC by a
OL,15,Fpersonal representative, Huang said: "I
OL,16,Fhave made serious mistakes in my
OL,17,Fpersonal life. I created problems for
OL,18,Fthe Board that I deeply regret. I own
OL,19,Fmy mistakes completely."
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
