OL,3,AJensen Huang says he would return as
OL,4,ANvidia boss if asked by the board
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut he said he had had an "outpouring"
OL,7,Fof calls from company employees,
OL,8,Finvestors and others calling for him to
OL,9,Freturn as CEO of Nvidia.
OL,11,FThe AI chip giant is set to report its
OL,12,Ffinancial results later on Tuesday.
